  Description: "COMPANION / RARE / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nClockwork Union companions gain
    4% movement AND attack speed per talent. Combined with Bullhorn Warrior, this
    buff is capped at 25%.\r\n\nSUPPORT WHILE OWNED\nChampion / Dodge: +2.5%\nChampion
    / Maximum health: -1\nTier 1/2/3 traits \xD71/2/4; merging three units reduces
    support sources.\n\r\n\nLIFE IN THE WAITING REALM\nA wetland courier injured
    in the machinery district, they chose a spring prosthesis made by a friend. The
    spring helps their life continue; it did not create it. They want to return the
    friend's tools and report that the crossing worked.\r\nPERSONAL PASSIVE\nNo additional
    periodic personal passive.\r\n\nNamed talents count bodies and absorbed memories;
    their stated percentages are not multiplied by star level unless explicitly stated.
    Listed support modifiers scale separately at 1/2/4.\r\nBonds: clock, gear. Immortal.
    Weapon rolls on recruitment; three equal-species/equal-star bodies merge unless
    the talent forbids it."
